ok: advance-checkpoint leaves the clock unchanged
advance-clock --duration-ms 5000 moves the clock by 5000 ms
ok: advance-clock reports the digest of the clock transaction
status shows the tip moved by 2
status shows the clock moved by 5000 ms
ok: the fork point is unchanged
advance-clock without a duration moves the clock by 1 ms
